Package: supershot
Version: 1.1.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 4248
Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), xdg-desktop-portal-gnome, libglib2.0-bin
Maintainer: axpnet <https://github.com/axpnet>
Homepage: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/axpnet/supershot
Description: GTK4/Libadwaita screenshot tool for GNOME
 SuperShot is a native screenshot tool for GNOME desktops with configurable
 delay timer, PNG/JPEG format selection, date/time watermark, preview window
 with crop support, custom save directory, automatic clipboard copy,
 clickable desktop notifications, CLI headless mode, and 14 language
 translations. Built with GTK4 and Libadwaita.
